<title>ABU DHABI: SOCCER-SAUDI ARAB BEAT CHINA 4-3 IN ASIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SAUDI ARAB BEAT CHINA 4-3 IN ASIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia beat China 4-3 (halftime 3-2) in their Asian Cup quarter-final on Monday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia - Yousif Al Thunai 31, 65, Sami Al Jaber 34, Fahad Al Mahalel 43</p>
<p>China - Zhang Enhua 6, 89, Peng Weigu 16</p>
<p>Attendence: 5,000</p>
</text>
